    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "The Last Key"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "A short film treatment for a production decision"
    },
    {
      "style": "Caption",
      "text": "Shot outline · Cost · Next decisions"
    },
    {
      "style": "Metadata",
      "text": "Fictional production brief • Revision A • 3 October 2026 • Written for producer Inez Vale, director…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Decision requested by 9 October 2026: approve a technical scout and a costed rehearsal plan for a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Caption",
      "text": "Study A1 · The room before arrival. The empty stool stands apart from the bench; the left window…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "An older repairer clears a bench for the person taking over the workshop. Their final task is not to…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The producer can approve the scout without approving the shoot. Director and producer will review…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "The story in one breath"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Mara has worked in this room for thirty years. On the last afternoon before she hands it to Noor, she…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The radio never plays. The ending rests on the new position of the stool, a practical alteration that…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Three scenes"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Scene one The room before arrival"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "0:00–0:48 • Interior workshop • Staged late afternoon."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "An empty chair occupies the foreground. Mara enters from the far side of the frame and wipes one small…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The camera waits for actions to finish. We need the view of the empty chair, the cloth and the radio to…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Scene two Making space"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "0:48–2:02 • Same workshop • Continuous action."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Noor remains beside the door until Mara clears a place for the tool roll. They stand on the same side…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The exchange has two lines. Preserve the pauses and the small shift in who owns the pencil. Do not add…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Caption",
      "text": "Study A2 · The pencil changes hands. The shared diagonal makes the offer readable while the radio…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Scene three The chair moves"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "2:02–3:00 • Same workshop • Continuous action, then a short time ellipsis."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Mara leaves the key beside Noor's open hand. Neither closes the distance immediately. They listen to a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "No smile to camera, no restored radio and no new customer entering. Those alternatives would turn a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Caption",
      "text": "Study A3 · The chair moves. The doorway view returns with Noor seated at the bench and the foreground…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Visual references we will make"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "These are original shot studies to create after the next phase is measured and routed. They are…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Caption",
      "text": "Illustration update · 3 October 2026: studies A1–A3 now accompany this treatment. The preceding…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "We recommend a quiet, locked-camera approach with a single gentle lateral move during the shared bench…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The palette comes from original material choices: paper cream, graphite grey, muted rust on the cloth…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Sound and accessible delivery"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Record the two lines cleanly and collect separate room tone, cloth, latch, pencil and stool sounds. Use…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The planned master is 1920 × 1080, 16:9, 24 fps, 180 seconds including a 10-second title/credit card.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Shot outline"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Durations are editorial allocations, not measured footage. All 12 shots total 180 seconds. Scene…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "People place and schedule"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Producer Inez Vale owns budget, permissions and the shoot decision. Director Samir Reed owns…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The intended location is a privately controlled workshop interior, address unknown. Use one room…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "All times are local to the eventual location; timezone and access terms are unresolved. A scout that…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Cost and commitments"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Illustrative USD planning allowances, including tax/fees within each line where applicable; all…"
