    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "If actual quotes exceed the ceiling, the producer must revise scope or funding. Do not remove captions,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Holds and next decisions"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "At the scout, test three things: whether the opening and closing wide views can share a safe camera…"
